    <Element type="timing" name="HangBelemNgocHueu2nm">
      <EffectLayer>
        <Effect label="Dem dong lanh leo chua sinh ra doi Chua sinh ra doi nam trong hang da noi mang lua Trong hang Be Lem anh sang toa lang tung bung Nghe tren khong trung tieng hat thien than vang lung  Dan hat reo rat tieng hat, suong ca du am vang xa Day chua thien toa giang sinh vi ta Nguoi hoi hay kip buoc toi, den xem noi hang Be Lem Oi chua giang sinh kho khan thap hen.  Nua dem mung chua giang sinh ra chon nhan tran Nguoi dem an phuc xuong cho muon dan lam than Noi hang Be Lem thien than suong ca Thien chua vinh danh chung dan an hoa Dem dong lanh leo chua sinh ra doi Chua sinh ra doi nam trong hang da noi mang lua Trong hang Be Lem anh sang toa lang tung bung Nghe tren khong trung tieng hat thien than vang lung  Dan hat reo rat tieng hat, suong ca du am vang xa Day chua thien toa giang sinh vi ta Nguoi hoi hay kip buoc toi, den xem noi hang Be Lem Oi chua giang sinh kho khan thap hen. Nua dem thien chua giang sinh ra chon gian tran Nguoi dem an phuc xuong cho muon dan lam than Noi hang Be Lem tieng lua tho hoi Tan gia dem dong am than con nguoi Dem dong lanh leo chua sinh ra doi Chua sinh ra doi nam trong hang da noi mang lua Trong hang Be Lem anh sang toa lang tung bung Nghe tren khong trung tieng hat thien than vang lung  Dan hat reo rat tieng hat, suong ca du am vang xa Day chua thien toa giang sinh vi ta Nguoi hoi hay kip buoc toi, den xem noi hang Be Lem Oi chua giang sinh kho khan thap hen." startTime="11600" endTime="196950"></Effect>
      </EffectLayer>
      <EffectLayer>
